textkit columns: invalid argument many
Options:
  --separator <str>  The field separator (default a tab)
  --gap <int>        Spaces between columns (default 2)
  --right            Align every column but the first to the right
  --limit <int>      The most bytes to read, all inputs together (default 8388608)
Arguments:
  <files>...         Files to read; none, or -, is standard input
